-- 6. an IMPORTED name answers
exp of math.exp, at the call: ```y|exp(x: float) -> float|```||── exp ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────|exp(x): e^x. The argument is split as k*ln2 + r, the kernel computes e^r in|[0.707, 1.414), and 2^k goes back on by adding to the exponent field -- which|is exact, so the whole answer is as accurate as the kernel and the reduction.
e, bound from an import: ```y|float|```||```y|e|```
